Inclusions: The Ancestor Instinct
Inclusions: The entire pageant of human history
Inclusions: Most humans desire cultural stability, not change
Inclusions: Progress depends on retentiveness
Inclusions: Taking a fence down

Body:

Human culture advances because we retain things that work, and are careful about trying and proving new things. 

And we share what works with others, and we pass this hard-earned knowledge down across  generations. 

